  "description": "How the host reports each binary extraction outcome (plugin-protocol.md section 5.5.4). Each case in cases gives the document path, the wire result entry for that document, the run exit code when no finding fails a gate, the notices the host adds to the root notices of the lint report, and the codes it adds to that document's unchecked list. Content a document skips is an info notice and never unchecked. A no-source result depends on the name: .drawio.png, .excalidraw.png and .drawio.svg promise a source, and every other name does not. host_cases are inputs the host decides without a wire result: sent_to_extractor is false when no extractor gets the file. A null code means that the CLI routing bead slopvac-8l4.20.13 fixes it. validator_cases give the code the shared validator reports when output fails it, by the source of that output. Every listed notice code appears in every output format (host row H46).",
